  "translation": "A bɛ jɔ misi fila ni tan kan: saba ɲɛbɔlen sahelan fɛ, ani saba ɲɛbɔlen tilebin fɛ, ani saba ɲɛbɔlen worodugu fɛ, ani saba ɲɛbɔlen kɔgɔyan fɛ; kɔgɔji-kaba bɛ u sanfɛ, u aɲɔfɛnw bɛɛ bɛ ⟨a kɔnɔtɔ⟩ fɛ.",
